                  <photoshop:LayerName>Optional Function ID , Work Code, RS232 Printer  Power &amp; Enviro</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Optional Function ID , Work Code, RS232 Printer  Power &amp; Environment Battery : (Optional) Power Supply : DC 12V --- 1.5A Verifcation Speed : â‰¤0.5 Sec Operating Temperature : 0OC - 45oC Dimension (in mm) : (L)167.5 x (W)148.8 x (H)32.2  Features - High verification speed - Professional firmware and platform make it more flexible - Intuitive and stunning UI design - Sophisticated and lightweight design, fits in any environment</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Storage Capacity Face Capacity : 1,500 Fingerprint Capacity : 2</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Storage Capacity Face Capacity : 1,500 Fingerprint Capacity : 2,000 ID card Capacity : 2,000 Transaction Capacity : 1,00,000  Visual Display : 2.8-inch TFT Screen  Communication Communication : TCP/IP, USB-Host Push Data : Yes  Standard Functions SMS, DLST, Scheduled-bell, Self-Service Query,  Automatic Status Switch, T9 Input, Photo ID, Camera, Multi-verifcation  Interface for Access Control 3rd Party Electric Lock, Door Sensor, Exit Button, Alarm</photoshop:LayerText>
